1
00:00:00,120 --> 00:00:02,094
Hahahaha!

2
00:00:02,175 --> 00:00:05,213
Essa é a sua roda d'água?

3
00:00:06,904 --> 00:00:09,069
Mano, gira ao contrário.

4
00:00:09,426 --> 00:00:10,505
Ao contrário…

5
00:00:10,626 --> 00:00:12,552
O ângulo das pás,

6
00:00:12,628 --> 00:00:13,650
tá contra a água.

7
00:00:14,013 --> 00:00:15,802
Vira elas, que gira.

8
00:00:15,865 --> 00:00:17,379
Doze pás,

9
00:00:17,437 --> 00:00:19,263
até o pôr do sol?

10
00:00:20,839 --> 00:00:22,366
Missão da seca:

11
00:00:22,439 --> 00:00:24,663
vence hoje ao pôr do sol.

12
00:00:24,747 --> 00:00:25,296
Qin Shuang,

13
00:00:25,355 --> 00:00:27,089
três turnos, duas horas.

14
00:00:27,218 --> 00:00:28,579
Turno um, pra água!

15
00:00:28,886 --> 00:00:30,670
Turno dois, tábuas!

16
00:00:32,691 --> 00:00:33,774
Quatro!

17
00:00:34,289 --> 00:00:34,717
Oito.

18
00:00:37,934 --> 00:00:39,492
Doze,

19
00:00:39,559 --> 00:00:40,367
pronto!

20
00:00:41,118 --> 00:00:42,851
Ancião Han, abra.

21
00:00:44,667 --> 00:00:45,392
Gira…

22
00:00:51,088 --> 00:00:52,128
Girou!

23
00:00:54,920 --> 00:00:55,932
Água…

24
00:00:55,987 --> 00:00:58,077
A água chegou!

25
00:00:58,181 --> 00:00:59,794
Mestre Xu.

26
00:00:59,854 --> 00:01:00,438
Levantem,

27
00:01:01,028 --> 00:01:02,281
sem ajoelhar!

28
00:01:02,559 --> 00:01:05,170
Minha… represa…

29
00:01:05,245 --> 00:01:06,460
Senhor Qian,

30
00:01:06,530 --> 00:01:08,365
guarda a represa pra lavar o pé.

31
00:01:11,094 --> 00:01:13,381
Missão da seca: concluída.

32
00:01:13,462 --> 00:01:15,007
Sementes salvas.

33
00:01:15,081 --> 00:01:15,887
Bebe água.

34
00:01:16,564 --> 00:01:18,431
Mano, agora gira certo!

35
00:01:18,511 --> 00:01:20,157
Você sorriu.

36
00:01:20,230 --> 00:01:20,739
Não.

37
00:01:23,830 --> 00:01:24,709
Mano…

38
00:01:24,768 --> 00:01:25,803
O norte.

39
00:01:26,333 --> 00:01:27,990
O vento tá frio.

40
00:01:30,011 --> 00:01:31,134
Ga…

41
00:01:31,191 --> 00:01:32,951
Gafanhotos!

42
00:01:35,031 --> 00:01:36,471
Xiaohe, segura firme.
